  "passage": {
    "text": "Farmers are stronger when they speak with one voice. The Chamber of Agriculture is an organization that represents farmers. It gives them advice about laws, taxes and new technology. It organizes training and conferences. It also negotiates with the government. Last month the president of the chamber went to the capital. She told the ministers, \"Farmers need lower costs and fair prices.\" The ministers listened carefully. Next week the chamber is going to hold a big meeting with farmers from all the regions. Together, farmers can influence policy.",
